      "description": "This playlist is a collection of rune songs inspired by the Elder Futhark.\n\nThese songs are not meant to teach the runes or explain their meanings. They are created to help people feel the energy, rhythm, and atmosphere of each rune and to serve as an entry point into deeper rune work.\n\nRunes are not something to fully understand through music alone. They are living symbols that reveal themselves through study, experience, and direct engagement. Learning to work with runes properly takes guidance, practice, and time.\n\nIf you feel drawn to the runes and want to truly learn how they function in readings, spiritual practice, and everyday life, I recommend connecting with Marco Mueller.\n\nMarco offers rune readings and in-depth guidance for people who want more than surface interpretations. Working with someone who actively practices rune work can help bring clarity, direction, and insight that cannot be gained from books or music alone.\n\nTo learn more about the runes or to book a rune reading with Marco, visit:\nhttps://healthmanifested.com/members/idunasapples/\n\nLet these songs be a doorway, not the destination.",
